+        // than the receiver gives the penumbra width (receiver - blocker) * pcss.x, clamped to pcss.y..pcss.z (UV), and
+        // eight compares on a disc of that radius average to the result. With pcss.x at 0 the original single compare
+        // runs. The cascades are orthographic, so the depth difference is a distance along the light.
